Cell["\<\
The square grid, the square mesh and the square torus. The least symmetry of \
the grid exchanges two pendant vertices; the mesh has none; the torus has the \
translations by one step:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"969708b4-5f13-4c2b-808d-bf3f61e1bc07"],

